### Delete a blog (change id if needed), paste token from login
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/blogs/1
Authorization: Bearer <token>

### Should fail - year too old
POST http://localhost:3001/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>

{
  "title": "Old blog",
  "author": "Someone",
  "url": "https://test.com",
  "year": 1990
}

###  Should fail - year in future
POST http://localhost:3001/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>

{
  "title": "Future blog",
  "author": "Someone",
  "url": "https://test.com",
  "year": 2099
}

### Should succeed
POST http://localhost:3001/api/blogs
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token>

{
  "title": "Valid blog",
  "author": "Someone",
  "url": "https://test.com",
  "year": 2024
}